  "content_html": "<p>&nbsp;<span style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiUpbStNP-TxUBUP6xQTwKo10gJoMMF9x2EexFx37Qnbeg2mrbcXCAdURGifEkjS-IM1oM01w4bfqt9aukMGZ1-kkNqdObrworXibAH9SVs6X0dcfyAGSXQndplhg6pknRax8zHd5iTf56BPaNaXmTvEIx7WOkAsypjjxB83Tm1LCvfVFYpypPYd_F4XYo/s291/%E2%80%8F%E2%80%8F%D7%9C%D7%9B%D7%99%D7%93%D7%94.PNG\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em; text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"רישום של ילד עם כובע מצחייה\" border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"291\" data-original-width=\"219\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiUpbStNP-TxUBUP6xQTwKo10gJoMMF9x2EexFx37Qnbeg2mrbcXCAdURGifEkjS-IM1oM01w4bfqt9aukMGZ1-kkNqdObrworXibAH9SVs6X0dcfyAGSXQndplhg6pknRax8zHd5iTf56BPaNaXmTvEIx7WOkAsypjjxB83Tm1LCvfVFYpypPYd_F4XYo/s16000/%E2%80%8F%E2%80%8F%D7%9C%D7%9B%D7%99%D7%93%D7%94.PNG\" /></a></p><h2><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🎈&nbsp;</span><span data-end=\"108\" data-start=\"73\" style=\"font-family: arial;\">שיחה בציורים -&nbsp;כְּשֶׁהַבְּרָכוֹת מְדַבְּרוֹת</span></span></h2><p></p><div><p data-end=\"242\" data-start=\"158\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">☮️ <b>הַשָּׁלוֹם</b> (בְּשַׁלְוָה):<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">כְּשֶׁאַתֶּם הוֹלְכִים&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">בְּחֻקֵּי הַתּוֹרָה,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אֲנִי נִכְנָס לַבָּתִּים.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">- לֹא מְרִיבָה,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">- לֹא פַּחַד<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">רַק רוֹגַע.</span></span></p><p data-end=\"242\" data-start=\"158\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🌧️ <b>הַגֶּשֶׁם</b> (בִּשִׂמְחָה):<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וְ</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אֲנִי יוֹרֵד בִּזְמַנִּי.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">כְּשֶׁהַשָּׂדוֹת צְרִיכִים -&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אֲנִי בָּא.</span></span></p><p data-end=\"242\" data-start=\"158\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🌾 <b>הַיְבוּל</b> (בְּגַאֲוָה שֶׁקֶטָה):<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">הַשָּׂדוֹת מְלֵאִים.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">הַמַּחְסָנִים מִתְמַלְּאִים.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">יֵשׁ מַה לֶאֱכֹל,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וְיֵשׁ&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">מַה&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">לַחְלֹק.</span></span></p><p data-end=\"242\" data-start=\"158\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🚪</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">&nbsp;<b>הַבִּטָּחוֹן</b> (בְּחִיּוּךְ):<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אֲנָשִׁים יְשֵׁנִים בְּשֶׁקֶט.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">הַדְּלָתוֹת פְּתוּחוֹת,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וְאֵין פַּחַד.</span></span></p><p data-end=\"242\" data-start=\"158\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🛡️ <b>הַהֲגָנָה</b> (בְּעֵרָנוּת):<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אֲנִי עוֹמֶדֶת סְבִיבְכֶם.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">כְּשֶׁיֵּשׁ אֱמֶת -&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">יֵשׁ גַּם שְׁמִירָה.</span></span></p><p data-end=\"242\" data-start=\"158\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🏆 <b>הַנִּצָּחוֹן</b> (בְּבִטָּחוֹן):<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אֲנִי לֹא רַק כֹּחַ -&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אֲנִי דֶּרֶךְ נְכוֹנָה.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">כְּשֶׁהוֹלְכִים בַּטּוֹב -&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">מַצְלִיחִים.</span></span></p><p data-end=\"242\" data-start=\"158\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🤝 <b>הָאַחְדוּת</b> (בַּחֲמִימוּת):<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">כֻּלָּם יַחַד.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אֵין אֶחָד לְבַד -&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">יֵשׁ עַם.</span></span></p><p data-end=\"242\" data-start=\"158\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">👶 <b>הַפְּרִיָּה</b> (בְּתִקְוָה):<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">יֵשׁ יְלָדִים,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">יֵשׁ עָתִיד.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">הַחַיִּים מַמְשִׁיכִים.</span></span></p><p data-end=\"242\" data-start=\"158\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🌳 <b>הַשֶּׁקֶט בָּאָרֶץ</b> (בְּנַחַת):<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">הָעֵצִים גְּדֵלִים בְּלִי פַּחַד.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">הַדֶּרֶכִים שְׁקֵטוֹת.</span></span></p><p data-end=\"242\" data-start=\"158\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">✨ <b>הַבְּרָכָה</b> (בְּאוֹר):<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">כְּשֶׁאַתֶּם הוֹלְכִים בְּחֻקּוֹתַי -<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אֲנִי מַקִּיפָה אֶת הַכֹּל.</span></span></p><p data-end=\"242\" data-start=\"158\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">📖 <b>הַתּוֹרָה</b> (בְּרַכּוּת):<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אֲנִי הַדֶּרֶךְ.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וְכָל הַבְּרָכוֹת -&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">הוֹלְכוֹת אַחֲרַי.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וּמִי שֶׁיִּלְמַד וְיִפְתַּח אֶת לִבּוֹ -&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">יְבֹרַךְ.</span></span></p></div><div><h2><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">תפזורת ברכות מובטחות</span></h2></div><div><span style=\"background-color: white;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span><span>מצאו את&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"font-weight: bold;\">🔍</strong><span>&nbsp;הברכות בפרשה: גֶּשֶׁם, יְבוּל, פְּרִי, דַּיִשׁ, בָּצִיר, שֹׂבַע, בִּטָּחוֹן, שָׁלוֹם, מִשְׁכָּן, קוֹמְמִיּוּת.</span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">בכיוונים&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">⬅️ ➡️ ⬇️ ⬆️</span></span><br /><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhPQfC8KLlUaeRWDAGXEI5nLKSpGJk02jwd2_l0aMHkT5F2XcnB2gPj8fvOnWDDz-svH80_cvQQ4pJjoe3g8mC863ieggyiHBOvgzGZDvGXQNd7feRnZ2QwvFOjudFTQUVs5aSmPGbmcw38Z1vz80k5XpOdWMqVlsKfqvmw8p6-LpGRCSq_-2eS2PO3orc/s465/%E2%80%8F%E2%80%8F%D7%9C%D7%9B%D7%99%D7%93%D7%94.PNG\" style=\"clear: right; display: inline; margin-bottom: 1em; margin-left: 1em; text-align: center;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"458\" data-original-width=\"465\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhPQfC8KLlUaeRWDAGXEI5nLKSpGJk02jwd2_l0aMHkT5F2XcnB2gPj8fvOnWDDz-svH80_cvQQ4pJjoe3g8mC863ieggyiHBOvgzGZDvGXQNd7feRnZ2QwvFOjudFTQUVs5aSmPGbmcw38Z1vz80k5XpOdWMqVlsKfqvmw8p6-LpGRCSq_-2eS2PO3orc/s320/%E2%80%8F%E2%80%8F%D7%9C%D7%9B%D7%99%D7%93%D7%94.PNG\" width=\"320\" /></a></div><div><h2><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">נכון או לא בפרשה?</span></h2><ol><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אִם עַם יִשְׂרָאֵל שׁוֹמֵר מִצְווֹת - בָּא גֶּשֶׁם בַּזְּמַן?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">שָׁלוֹם וּבִטָּחוֹן הֵם חֵלֶק מִן הַבְּרָכוֹת?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אֵין קֶשֶׁר בֵּין שְׁמִירַת הַמִּצְווֹת לְבֵין מָה שֶׁקּוֹרֶה בָּאָרֶץ?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">בַּפָּרָשָׁה, מֻזְכָּרִים גַּם עֳנָשִׁים אִם לֹא שׁוֹמְעִים בְּקוֹל ה'?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הַתּוֹרָה מְתָאֶרֶת רָעָב וְצָרוֹת כְּחֵלֶק מֵהָעֳנָשִׁים?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">גַּם כַּאֲשֶׁר יֵשׁ עֹנֶשׁ, ה' לֹא עוֹזֵב אֶת עַם יִשְׂרָאֵל לְגַמְרֵי?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">ה' זוֹכֵר לְעוֹלָמִים אֶת הַבְּרִית שֶׁכָּרַת עִם הָאָבוֹת?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הַתּוֹרָה מַבְטִיחָה שֶׁלֹּא יִהְיוּ מִלְחָמוֹת לְעוֹלָם?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">\"וְנָתַתִּי שָׁלוֹם בָּאָרֶץ\" הוּא פָּסוּק מִפָּרָשַׁת בְּחֻקּוֹתַי?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הַפָּרָשָׁה מְלַמֶּדֶת שֶׁיֵּשׁ קֶשֶׁר בֵּין הַמַּעֲשִׂים שֶׁל הָאָדָם לְבֵין מָה שֶׁקּוֹרֶה בָּעוֹלָם?</span></li></ol></div>"
}
